    "limitations": [
      "The complete release contains no standalone reduced .dat and the four model roots omit measured datasets. The demo uses sample 1039 and 1041, manual beam regions and an explicit 1.05 example scale. These are insufficient to reconstruct the figures with established byte equality.",
      "All HPLC ratio and state fields are empty. Actual SLD may differ from nominal values. Published jointly fitted layer solutions and per-contrast offsets/scales are descriptive prior exposure and excluded from fit initialization and held calibration.",
      "Every stored root start and end timestamp is the same within its own file. File stamps span 9 h 37 min 20 s across reflected acquisitions, with independent positive monitor counting durations. Film time-invariance, incident beam stability and solvent penetration remain assumptions.",
      "Finite source-angle, waist and white spectrum resolution can change the contrast identity after averaging. Actual kernels may differ across scans. There is no certified infinite-dimensional common material profile from a selection of pointwise disk coordinates."
    ],
