  "freeze": "Before any observed reflected histogram enters a numerical reducer. No all-contrast fitted numeric model, held power, held background, target-dependent mask or gain may enter a forecast.",
  "unit": "Single hPS-on-Si wafer; D2O and H2O are calibration, CM4 and CMSi are the two held solvent exchange acquisitions. Angles and q bins are nested. They are not independent films.",
  "receiver": {
    "versions": {
